    "description": "The Careers Applications History API provides access to the historical records of job applications submitted through the career portal. It allows users to retrieve detailed information about their past application submissions, including status updates and timestamps. This API is particularly useful for job seekers wanting to track their application progress or analyze their job application patterns. Typical consumers of this API include candidates, recruiters, and HR professionals looking to manage and review application histories.",
